<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.174>	" Suspicor, et ssevos alios mansuescere crines.
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.175>	" Omnis in hoc casu feritas admissa nocendi
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.176>	" Cederet, inflexi pietas adamanta rigoris
