<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.460>	Meta deum clausura dapes, connubia virtus
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.461>	Sanciat, et derapto convivia fine perennet.
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.462>	Hie igitvu suspend stylum, piocedere ruptis
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.463>	Erubeo mensis, quarum produceie tempus
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.464>	Non breviasse decet, metiri prandia nolo,
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.465>	Qus8 Deus assiduo facial succedere gustu,
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.466>	Nee satie minuet epulandi fixa voluptas.
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.467>	O longum studii gremio nutrita togati
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.468>	Ingenii proles, rudis et plebeia libelle,
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.469>	Incolumis vivas, nee te languescere cogat
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.470>	Invidise morsus, quo morbificante bonorum
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.471>	Febricitat nomen, et eo tortore modernis
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.472>	iEgrescit titulus ; forsan tibi si qua favoris
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.473>	Uncia debetur, peplo livoris amicta
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.474>	Non poterit venisse palam, dum sorbeat auras
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.475>	Vivificas auctor ortum lux ilia Johannis
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.476>	Sumat in occasu, sol ille a funeris urna.
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.477>	Surgat inextincto semper spectabilis igne,
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.478>	Sub fati tenebris me noctescente diescat
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.479>	Hie liber, et famse veterum felicior annos
<johannes_hanville. architr. 9.480>	-quet, in feternum populis dilectus et ultra.
